 33.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9703, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5321, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "④ 原路跳回 → 再入背面", "originalText": "④ 原路跳回 → 再入背面", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 25}, {"id": "linked-faces-00314", "type": "text", "x": 1788, "y": 816, "width": 294.0, "height": 56.7, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9734, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5338, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "沿踏阶返回正面 R0 落点，\n借同一束光逆向回背面镜车旁。", "originalText": "沿踏阶返回正面 R0 落点，\n借同一束光逆向回背面镜车旁。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 21}, {"id": "linked-faces-00315", "type": "text", "x": 1788, "y": 918, "width": 271.0, "height": 33.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9765, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5355, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑤ 推镜过桥 → 返回墙后", "originalText": "⑤ 推镜过桥 → 返回墙后", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 25}, {"id": "linked-faces-00316", "type": "text", "x": 1788, "y": 961, "width": 336.0, "height": 56.7, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9796, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5372, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "实体推 R 镜车：R0 → R1。\n停在对应镜座，再化光回正面墙后。", "originalText": "实体推 R 镜车：R0 → R1。\n停在对应镜座，再化光回正面墙后。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 21}, {"id": "linked-faces-00317", "type": "text", "x": 1788, "y": 1063, "width": 271.0, "height": 33.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9827, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5389, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑥ 光鳞受光 → 进入雨槽", "originalText": "⑥ 光鳞受光 → 进入雨槽", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 25}, {"id": "linked-faces-00318", "type": "text", "x": 1788, "y": 1106, "width": 330.0, "height": 56.7, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9858, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5406, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "R1 对应的固定镜把光送向背鳞。\n出口舒展，实体向右进入第 08 关。", "originalText": "R1 对应的固定镜把光送向背鳞。\n出口舒展，实体向右进入第 08 关。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 21}, {"id": "linked-faces-00319", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1320, "width": 2280, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#CDD6D1", "backgroundColor": "#FFFDF8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9889, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5423, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "linked-faces-00320", "type": "text", "x": 86, "y": 1344, "width": 308.0, "height": 37.800000000000004, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9920, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5440, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "一面改变另一面的可达性", "originalText": "一面改变另一面的可达性", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 28}, {"id": "linked-faces-00321", "type": "text", "x": 86, "y": 1395, "width": 450.0, "height": 62.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5457, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "K背 展开正面踏阶 → 才够到 K前。\nK前 开背面轨桥 → 镜车才能越过叶墙后方。", "originalText": "K背 展开正面踏阶 → 才够到 K前。\nK前 开背面轨桥 → 镜车才能越过叶墙后方。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-00322", "type": "text", "x": 839, "y": 1344, "width": 224.0, "height": 37.800000000000004, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 9982, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5474, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "跳跃承担具体目的", "originalText": "跳跃承担具体目的", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 28}, {"id": "linked-faces-00323", "type": "text", "x": 839, "y": 1395, "width": 460.0, "height": 62.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10013, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5491, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "背面向上找开路机关；正面错层跳到远端。\n已展开的平台保留，回访有可以读懂的路线。", "originalText": "背面向上找开路机关；正面错层跳到远端。\n已展开的平台保留，回访有可以读懂的路线。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-00324", "type": "text", "x": 1592, "y": 1344, "width": 252.0, "height": 37.800000000000004, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10044, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5508, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "回程落点由镜车决定", "originalText": "回程落点由镜车决定", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 28}, {"id": "linked-faces-00325", "type": "text", "x": 1592, "y": 1395, "width": 483.0, "height": 62.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10075, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5525, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "R0 回到叶墙之前；R1 回到叶墙之后。\n只移动一只镜车，不增加第二束光或自由传送。", "originalText": "R0 回到叶墙之前；R1 回到叶墙之后。\n只移动一只镜车，不增加第二束光或自由传送。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-00326", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 1575, "width": 1061.0, "height": 32.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263B40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10106, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5542, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "图中上栏 A、下栏 B 是同一藤架的前后展开，不是上下楼；紫线代表纵深通光，不是可跳跃的竖井。", "originalText": "图中上栏 A、下栏 B 是同一藤架的前后展开，不是上下楼；紫线代表纵深通光，不是可跳跃的竖井。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 24}, {"id": "linked-faces-00327", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 1620, "width": 1054.0, "height": 31.05, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10137, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5559, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "正面 R0 的光在落脚点旁截停，照不到跳台区；必须恢复实体跳跃。背面桥未开时，有实际断轨和挡叶。", "originalText": "正面 R0 的光在落脚点旁截停，照不到跳台区；必须恢复实体跳跃。背面桥未开时，有实际断轨和挡叶。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-00328", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 1661, "width": 1083.0, "height": 31.05, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10168, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5576, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "站光三秒化光，手动前后移动；开路机关锁止保留。只有 R0 / R1 镜窗可通向正面，其余位置有实心背衬。", "originalText": "站光三秒化光，手动前后移动；开路机关锁止保留。只有 R0 / R1 镜窗可通向正面，其余位置有实心背衬。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-00329", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 1701, "width": 1015.0, "height": 27.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10199, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5593, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "v02 设计提案 · 主图为两处机关已开的完成态 · 尚未实装；反射、跨层镜映射、跳距、碰撞与镜车扫掠需灰盒验证。", "originalText": "v02 设计提案 · 主图为两处机关已开的完成态 · 尚未实装；反射、跨层镜映射、跳距、碰撞与镜车扫掠需灰盒验证。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 20}, {"id": "linked-faces-00330", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 1840, "width": 2400, "height": 1740, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#F7F5EF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10230, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5610, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "linked-faces-00331", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1878, "width": 876.0, "height": 56.7, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263B40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10261, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5627, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 42, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "07  四个状态｜前后交替，机关与路线互相依赖", "originalText": "07  四个状态｜前后交替，机关与路线互相依赖", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 42}, {"id": "linked-faces-00332", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 1942, "width": 874.0, "height": 31.05, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 10292, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5644, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "每个框内都把正面与背面同时展开，光路通过紫线连接；上下两段金线属于同一束光。", "originalText": "每个框内都把正面与背面同时展开，光路通过紫线连接；上下两段金线属于同一束光。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-00333", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1995, "width": 1100, "height": 710, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#CDD6D1", "backgroundColo