": "linked-faces-01207", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1824, "y": 3212, "width": 165.0, "height": 32.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#FFFDF8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 37417, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20519, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "linked-faces-01208", "type": "text", "x": 1831, "y": 3215, "width": 151.0, "height": 27.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#478568", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 37448, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20536, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "同一镜车已在 R1", "originalText": "同一镜车已在 R1", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 20}, {"id": "linked-faces-01209", "type": "text", "x": 1262, "y": 3400, "width": 493.0, "height": 28.35, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 37479, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20553, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "R 位于 R1：纵深回程落点移到叶墙之后，出口开放。", "originalText": "R 位于 R1：纵深回程落点移到叶墙之后，出口开放。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 21}, {"id": "linked-faces-01210", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 3490, "width": 1068.0, "height": 31.05, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263B40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 37510, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20570, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "关键组合：开正面踏阶 → 到 K前；开背面轨桥 → 推 R 镜车；把 R 推过叶墙的世界 x 位置 → 返回墙后。", "originalText": "关键组合：开正面踏阶 → 到 K前；开背面轨桥 → 推 R 镜车；把 R 推过叶墙的世界 x 位置 → 返回墙后。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 23}, {"id": "linked-faces-01211", "type": "text", "x": 62, "y": 3534, "width": 1034.0, "height": 29.700000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 37541, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20587, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793836800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "镜车两处停靠位有明确配准标记；中途停错仍在背面安全轨道，可继续推或回推，不会把玩家困在另一面。", "originalText": "镜车两处停靠位有明确配准标记；中途停错仍在背面安全轨道，可继续推或回推，不会把玩家困在另一面。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 22}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#F7F5EF", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}